    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 3 Cassel House to the market. This is an attractive one bedroom apartment situated in an exceptionally convenient and well managed development. \n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, a generous double bedroom with fitted storage, and a spacious bathroom. Positioned on the second floor.\n\nLocated just a short walk from the thriving City Centre, this apartment has a wealth of amenities and services on its doorstep such as the Guinness Storehouse, Christchurch, trendy cafes and restaurants plus colleges such as Trinity College, Technological University Dublin. The area is also well serviced by public transport including multiple Dublin bus routes, Dublin City Bikes and the Luas.\n\nThis property is ideal for anyone looking for a convenient City Centre apartment and will appeal to those looking for a lucrative investment opportunity or homeowners alike.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.68m x 1.86m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.26m x 2.04m\n\n\nLiving Area - 2.95m x 2.83m\n\n\nDining - 2.83m x 1.57m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.44m x 2.68m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.35m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent central location</li><li> Measuring 40 Sq. M/ 431 Sq. Feet</li><li> Great investment opportunity</li><li> Within walking distance of Trinity College, Griffith College and Royal College of Surgeons Ireland</li><li> Area excellently serviced by public transport</li><li> 10 minute walk to Grafton Street and O'Connell Street</li><li> B BER rating</ul>"
